{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-03_beg","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-03","title":"麦秆，极易燃烧","storyCode":"R8-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"be2516f1491db922d193c28dc02e4df43e1dceba3d69080273c453478863687a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"感染者纠察队在村中搜查感染者，老人想为塔露拉顶罪，却惨遭杀害。塔露拉愤而出手。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"晖洁：\n接着上次那件事说。\n我逃了很久，逃到一个小村子里。\n我当时没想那么多，只是想找个地方藏起来，没想到我真的找到了一个栖身之所。\n这一对老夫妇，可能是把我当做了他们的女儿。毕竟乌萨斯那么多场战争，他们的子女可能很早就牺牲了。\n就连我的秘密他们也帮忙藏住了。\n我想我怎么报答他们都不过分。\n遗憾的是，我没能好好报答他们。\n1月13日"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次的例行检查中，我们有一个队员遭到了袭击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，每一户都要接受搜查。不仅是感染者，一旦我们发现袭击者，我们会立刻击杀他们，而窝藏他们的村户，也会受到惩罚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"不想服苦役的话，就告发他们。没人会因为你们光荣的报告受到伤害，而罪犯和感染者将得到他们应有的下场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，从第一户开始。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"老奶奶，这一天还是来了。我肯定是躲不过的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"别出去，塔露拉！藏在草棚后面......他们不会查的！我们就说你害怕受到惩罚，逃跑了！没有人会怪你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"可你们会被伤害的。这不该是我报答你们的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我留下了一点金币......这些是维多利亚金币，你们省着点花，一定够你们这辈子吃饱穿暖的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，塔露拉！你要去哪？我的塔露拉......不可以，你不可以和他们见面啊！这些纠察队的黑虫子吃人不眨眼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"所以不能让他们再压榨村子里的叔叔阿姨了。这种事应该有个结束。我会引开他们，警醒他们，我会让他们知道后果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道分寸的，老奶奶。我可不会让他们借机报复，再杀害村子里的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得隔壁的弟弟只是因为扔了个石头就被活活打死。我忘不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉......塔露拉！别这么说......别这么说！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"谁！谁在敲门......是纠察队吗！走开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老妈妈，是我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"阿丽娜！快进来，快进来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？发生什么事了？有消息吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"......有人告密了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？什么？什么告密？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"纠察队知道我们村子里有一个感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能，不会这样的......啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道他们从哪里得来的消息，但是我们都明白包藏感染者的下场是怎么个样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"老妈妈，我爸爸去世得早，妈妈也全赖你们照顾，我把你们就当是我自己的爷爷奶奶一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"到现在这个关头，我也没什么好隐瞒的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，爷爷他去了哪里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"臭老头子，你是来做什么的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我犯了罪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"自首？啊，对，我记得了。我们那个队员是被一个老头拦下了。看你这一瘸一拐的，你就是当时的袭击者之一吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"......看你也没什么油水可敲。有多远滚多远吧。那个小崽子也是不知好歹，跟穷农民犟什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不止。老爷，你看看我身上这块，你看像什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者！感染者就是你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"我当时给你换衣服的时候，都看到啦......塔露拉，你是感染者，我和老头子知道很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"那——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"老头子去矿场赚点钱，也是染了矿石病才回来的！你看他一直穿着他那个夹克不肯脱掉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"老头子是要替你顶罪啊，塔露拉......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"这岂不是说爷爷他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"村子里那些人都信不过的！只要是为了钱，为了保命，他们什么事儿都能往外说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"这两年，塔露拉，我们真的很欢喜你！你是个好孩子......是个好孩子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也没几天好活了，但是你，塔露拉，就算得了病，你也是能再多活几年的！你得好好活着才行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，别去！别去啊......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"抓我走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，抓我走吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你看我这身上！我才是那个得了病的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不信的话，你就看看这个吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"刀？把刀放下。老头，你伤不到我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不，老爷，你看看我的法术......你看看我的法术！"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人切开了自己的手腕，红色没有流进雪地，而是像雾一样弥散在空气中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你看......老爷！我是货真价实的感染者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_25"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢你的合作，感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉！回来！别去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么？！为什么房子烧起来了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉！这是你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"不要去！！塔露拉！！这样整个村子都会遭殃的！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
